Welcome to step two of running the R regression for my master's thesis!

This part is not mandatory to obtain the regression results. 

You will find here general-to-specific summary statistics for the climate, labor, and state data (e.g. share of agricultural employment...)

All the necessary data to run the scripts in this folder is either computed at the previous step (01_Data_cleaning) or is located in the attached data folder, under '/submission/Data/R/final dataframe construction'.

The exception to this is the ILOSTAT data, which can be retrieved directly from the ILO database.

You can run the script by following the numbering order, though the order matters little in this folder.

